exports[`visual regression snapshots > matter list and matter workspace 2`] = `
"<article aria-labelledby="sl-matter-heading"><header><h1 id="sl-matter-heading">Synthetic transaction review</h1><p class="sl-record-meta">Client: Synthetic Client <span class="sl-status-badge" data-tone="positive" style="color:#166534;background-color:#dcfce7;border-color:#166534"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-status-glyph">●</span><span>Open</span></span></p></header><div class="sl-v2-layout"><nav aria-label="Matter workspace" class="sl-matter-nav"><ul><li><a href="#ai-cockpit">AI cockpit</a></li><li><a href="#ai-operating-model">Operating model</a></li><li><a href="#corpus-map">Corpus map</a></li><li><a href="#ai-intake">AI intake</a></li><li><a href="#artifact-intake">Artifacts</a></li><li><a href="#element-matrix">Element matrix</a></li><li><a href="#recommendation">Recommendation</a></li><li><a href="#strategy-authority">Strategy and Authority</a></li><li><a href="#agent-team">Agent team</a></li><li><a href="#model-routing">Model routing</a></li><li><a href="#work-product-assembly">Work Product</a></li><li><a href="#deadline-actions">Deadlines and actions</a></li><li><a href="#source-run-evidence">Source and run evidence</a></li><li><a href="#case-log">Case log</a></li><li><a href="#failure-states">Failure states</a></li><li><a href="#delivery-map">Delivery map</a></li><li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li><li><a href="#parties">Parties</a></li><li><a href="#timeline">Timeline</a></li><li><a href="#facts-and-tensions">Facts and tensions</a></li><li><a href="#evidence">Evidence</a></li><li><a href="#issues-and-claims">Issues and claims</a></li><li><a href="#authorities">Authorities</a></li><li><a href="#communications">Communications</a></li><li><a href="#deadlines-and-tasks">Deadlines and tasks</a></li><li><a href="#work-products">Work products</a></li><li><a href="#actions-and-receipts">Actions and receipts</a></li><li><a href="#audit">Audit</a></li><li><a href="#feature-matrix">Feature matrix</a></li></ul></nav><div class="sl-v2-main-column"><div class="sl-v2-cockpit"><section id="ai-cockpit" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="AI Matter cockpit" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="available"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Matter scope and pinned context</p><h2>AI Matter cockpit</h2></header><div class="sl-v2-scope"><div><p class="sl-v2-kicker">AI-first public-synthetic workspace</p><h2>Synthetic transaction review</h2><p>Synthetic matter summary for workspace tests.</p></div><div class="sl-v2-pills" aria-label="Matter scope status"><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-good">Matter member</span><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-neutral">open</span><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-info">source grounded</span><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">Authority verification incomplete</span></div></div><p class="sl-v2-context">Snapshot <code>synthetic-snapshot-1</code> | adapter <code>0.1.0</code> | observed 2099-01-02T03:04:05Z</p><div class="sl-v2-composer" data-feature-state="safely-unavailable"><div><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Ask the AI case team</p><strong>What should we do next to close the highest-impact proof gap?</strong><p>Analysis execution is safely unavailable until a reviewed Agent input and recommendation contract is mounted.</p></div><button class="sl-button" type="button" disabled="">Analyze Matter</button></div><div class="sl-v2-ribbon" aria-label="Continuous analysis workflow"><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-good">scope passed</span><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-good">snapshot pinned</span><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-good">Issues mapped</span><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">Authority review</span><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-neutral">challenge unavailable</span><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-neutral">human decision required</span></div><div class="sl-v2-metrics"><div><span>Proof coverage</span><strong>67%</strong><small>2 supported Claims</small></div><div><span>Evidence Items</span><strong>1</strong><small>authorized Matter records</small></div><div><span>Record tensions</span><strong>1</strong><small>review required</small></div><div><span>Source links</span><strong>3</strong><small>support and counter-support</small></div></div><div class="sl-v2-ranked"><h3>Top ranked proposals</h3><article><span class="sl-v2-rank">1</span><div><strong>Verify controlling Authority before relying on any candidate Deadline</strong><p>Current workspace data has no joined operative Deadline and Authority contract.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">blocked by Authority lane</span></div></article><article><span class="sl-v2-rank">2</span><div><strong>The synthetic vehicle qualifies under the synthetic statute.</strong><p>Derived only from the authorized Claim ledger and Matter evidence already returned by the API.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">inert proposal preview</span></div></article></div></section><section id="ai-operating-model" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="AI operating model" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="available"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Automatic analysis, human-controlled effect</p><h2>AI operating model</h2></header><div class="sl-v2-decision"><div><strong>Architecture decision</strong><span>Keep the authorized Matter as the center of the AI-first case team.</span></div><div><strong>Existing foundation</strong><span>Typed records, provenance, policy, Claims, Work Products, Approval, and audit.</span></div><div><strong>Current boundary</strong><span>Models propose. Deterministic services and humans own state and legal effect.</span></div></div><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-4"><article class="sl-v2-card"><span class="sl-v2-step">1</span><h3>Observe</h3><p>Watch authorized Matter Events, Evidence Items, orders, Deadlines, and Work Product changes.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><span class="sl-v2-step">2</span><h3>Analyze</h3><p>Rebuild the Issue map, proof coverage, contradictions, Authority state, and record gaps.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><span class="sl-v2-step">3</span><h3>Prepare</h3><p>Offer inert Tasks, research queries, evidence requests, and draft Work Products.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><span class="sl-v2-step">4</span><h3>Bind or act</h3><p>Require an attributable human decision and the existing exact-version gate.</p></article></div><p class="sl-v2-callout">Course instruction + current Authority + Matter record + procedural posture + model inference = ranked typed proposal. No lane silently impersonates another.</p></section><section id="corpus-map" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Private corpus strategy map" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="proposal"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">HammerTime provenance, governed SKLegal retrieval</p><h2>Private corpus strategy map</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">proposal</span></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-3"><article class="sl-v2-card sl-v2-lane-course"><h3>Foundation</h3><p>Elements, burdens, planning, legal research, citations, and court rules.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card sl-v2-lane-course"><h3>Proceeding phase</h3><p>Pleadings, discovery, motions, evidence, trial, judgment, and appeal.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card sl-v2-lane-course"><h3>Matter type</h3><p>Contracts, debt, foreclosure, family, property, criminal, and general civil.</p></article></div><p class="sl-v2-unavailable">No private corpus text is embedded here. Governed retrieval remains available only through the existing Matter-scoped corpus route.</p></section><section id="ai-intake" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="AI-guided Matter intake" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="safely-unavailable"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Structure may be proposed, scope must be confirmed</p><h2>AI-guided Matter intake</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">safely-unavailable</span></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-2"><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Provide the case record</h3><p>Unified artifact intake is not mounted. Existing Evidence Items remain read-only below.</p><button class="sl-button" type="button" disabled="">Start AI intake proposal</button></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Highest-value questions</h3><ol><li>Which court and division own the Proceeding?</li><li>What relief is requested?</li><li>Which facts are admitted, disputed, unknown, or contradicted?</li></ol></article></div></section><section id="artifact-intake" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Matter artifacts and lineage" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="safely-unavailable"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Original preserved, derived artifacts separately traced</p><h2>Matter artifacts and lineage</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">safely-unavailable</span></header><div class="sl-v2-table-wrap"><table><caption>Authorized Evidence Item inventory</caption><thead><tr><th>Evidence Item</th><th>Media type</th><th>Content hash</th><th>Review state</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Synthetic executed agreement</th><td>application/pdf</td><td><code>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</code></td><td>collected</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="sl-v2-unavailable">Add, upload, OCR, transcription, classification, and request dispatch are not authorized by the current API.</p></section><section id="element-matrix" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Issue and essential Elements proof matrix" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="proposal"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Existing Claim support only, no invented Element state</p><h2>Issue and essential Elements proof matrix</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">proposal</span></header><div class="sl-v2-table-wrap"><table><caption>Public-synthetic proof map</caption><thead><tr><th>Claim</th><th>Support</th><th>Counter-support</th><th>Verification</th><th>Next safe step</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The synthetic vehicle qualifies under the synthetic statute.</th><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>failed</td><td>Review exact source records</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Synthetic notice was given within the statutory window.</th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>passed</td><td>Review exact source records</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id="recommendation" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Ranked recommendation detail" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="safely-unavailable"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Visible dimensions, prerequisites, and consequences</p><h2>Ranked recommendation detail</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">safely-unavailable</span></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-2"><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Recommendation schema is not mounted</h3><p>The cockpit does not invent a score, urgency, challenge disposition, or review state from adjacent records.</p><div class="sl-v2-score-lines"><span>Element impact <b>unknown</b></span><span>Authority fit <b>blocked</b></span><span>Evidence ready <b>partial</b></span></div></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Available controls</h3><p>Challenge, accept as proposed Task, request Work Product, and reject remain disabled until exact typed contracts exist.</p><button class="sl-button" type="button" disabled="">Accept as proposed Task</button></article></div></section><section id="strategy-authority" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Course strategy and jurisdiction overlay" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="proposal"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Source roles never blend</p><h2>Course strategy and jurisdiction overlay</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">proposal</span></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-2"><article class="sl-v2-card sl-v2-lane-course"><h3>Course instruction</h3><p>Instructional strategy remains separately labeled and requires an exact governed source span.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-course">instructional only</span></article><article class="sl-v2-card sl-v2-lane-authority"><h3>Current Authority</h3><p>3 source-linked support records require applicability review.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">applicability not ready</span></article></div></section><section id="agent-team" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="AI case team and challenge swarm" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="safely-unavailable"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Bounded specifications, typed outputs only</p><h2>AI case team and challenge swarm</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">safely-unavailable</span></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-4"><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Intake analyst</h3><p>Classifies Matter type, Proceeding phase, parties, events, and immediate gaps.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">not running</span></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Proof strategist</h3><p>Maps Claims, Defenses, Elements, burdens, Fact Assertions, and Evidence Items.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">not running</span></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Course researcher</h3><p>Routes source-derived instruction by phase and Matter type with exact spans.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">not running</span></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Authority reviewer</h3><p>Checks official sources, hierarchy, effective date, applicability, and contrary Authority.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">not running</span></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Deadline analyst</h3><p>Proposes triggers while deterministic calculation and human review remain required.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">not running</span></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Adversarial challenger</h3><p>Tests prerequisites, proof, admissibility, remedy, procedure, and downside risk.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">not running</span></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Work Product assembler</h3><p>Uses only reviewed Claims, bracketed unknowns, and verified citations.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">not running</span></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Orchestrator</h3><p>Owns bounded retries and waits. A model never owns workflow state.</p><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">not running</span></article></div></section><section id="model-routing" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Provider-neutral model routing seam" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="safely-unavailable"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Logical routes, never private hosts</p><h2>Provider-neutral model routing seam</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">safely-unavailable</span></header><div class="sl-v2-flow" aria-label="Model routing evidence flow"><span>Agent specification</span><b>to</b><span>logical route</span><b>to</b><span>policy and rights</span><b>to</b><span>pinned schema</span><b>to</b><span>transport profile</span><b>to</b><span>served-model evidence</span></div><p class="sl-v2-unavailable">No model request is sent. Direct Qwen, SKGateway, and OpenAI bindings remain outside this React state.</p></section><section id="work-product-assembly" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="AI Work Product assembly" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="proposal"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Exact versions, sentence grounding, and Approval invalidation</p><h2>AI Work Product assembly</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">proposal</span></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-2"><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Synthetic demand letter</h3><p>letter | in_review</p><dl><dt>Version</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Hash</dt><dd><code>dddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddd</code></dd><dt>Approval</dt><dd>bound to version 2</dd></dl><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-good">exact version bound</span></article></div><p class="sl-v2-unavailable">AI assembly and Approval mutation are not mounted. Editing an approved artifact must create a new version and invalidate prior Approval.</p></section><section id="deadline-actions" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Tasks, Deadlines, and external-action handoff" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="safely-unavailable"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">AI proposes, deterministic services calculate, humans approve</p><h2>Tasks, Deadlines, and external-action handoff</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-warn">safely-unavailable</span></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-3"><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Proposed Tasks</h3><p>No reviewed Task mutation contract is mounted.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Candidate Deadline</h3><p>Rule, trigger, timezone, deterministic calculation, and reviewer are required before any date is operative.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>External action</h3><p>Accepting a recommendation never files, serves, emails, schedules, or dispatches.</p></article></div><div class="sl-v2-flow" aria-label="External action state machine"><span>draft</span><b>to</b><span>validated</span><b>to</b><span>approved</span><b>to</b><span>queued</span><b>to</b><span>dispatched</span><b>to</b><span>receipt verified</span></div></section><section id="source-run-evidence" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Exact source and run evidence" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="proposal"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Replayable source, policy, and execution identity</p><h2>Exact source and run evidence</h2><span class="sl-v2-pill sl-v2-pill-model">proposal</span></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-2"><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Source evidence</h3><dl><dt>Snapshot</dt><dd><code>synthetic-snapshot-1</code></dd><dt>Source files</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Observed</dt><dd>2099-01-02T03:04:05Z</dd></dl></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Agent Run evidence</h3><p>Safely unavailable: no Agent Run HTTP surface returned route, prompt, schema, served model, usage, or policy evidence.</p></article></div></section><section id="case-log" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Matter activity and provenance log" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="available"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Readable projection over immutable records</p><h2>Matter activity and provenance log</h2></header><div class="sl-v2-log"><article><time>2099-01-03T00:00:00Z</time><div><strong>pilot_mapping_review.approved</strong><p>Synthetic Human Reviewer | outcome approved</p><p>synthetic-review-artifact#approved</p></div></article></div><p class="sl-v2-unavailable">Chronology, manifest, dossier, and action-log exports are safely unavailable until versioned Work Product contracts exist.</p></section><section id="failure-states" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="Failure and incomplete states" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="available"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Useful work continues only where authorized</p><h2>Failure and incomplete states</h2></header><div class="sl-v2-table-wrap"><table><caption>Explicit failure and incomplete-state behavior</caption><thead><tr><th>State</th><th>UI treatment</th><th>Blocked result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Policy unavailable or access denied</th><td>Uniform denial with no source oracle</td><td>All protected analysis</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Authority missing, stale, or contrary</th><td>Show the exact defect beside the proposal</td><td>Deadline and filing-ready state</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fact tension or Evidence gap</th><td>Show both assertions and the missing proof</td><td>Affected Element and grounded sentence</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Model timeout or schema failure</th><td>Typed failure with bounded retry state</td><td>Partial output never enters state</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Artifact changed after Approval</th><td>Invalidate the Approval and highlight the new hash</td><td>Queue and dispatch</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id="delivery-map" class="sl-v2-surface" aria-label="V2 delivery map" tabindex="-1" data-feature-state="available"><header class="sl-v2-surface-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Current reality and explicit dependencies</p><h2>V2 delivery map</h2></header><div class="sl-v2-grid sl-v2-grid-3"><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Implemented now</h3><p>Matter shell, authorized records, Claims, source links, Work Products, audit, provenance, and explicit negative state.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Safely unavailable</h3><p>Recommendation schema, strategist, challenge, joined Authority, unified intake, model evidence, and general decision surface.</p></article><article class="sl-v2-card"><h3>Separately gated</h3><p>Provider traffic, protected context, Deadline calculation, Approval mutation, connectors, dispatch, and external effects.</p></article></div></section></div><div class="sl-v2-records" aria-label="Authorized Matter records"><header class="sl-v2-records-head"><p class="sl-v2-eyebrow">Authorized API record</p><h2>Underlying Matter workspace</h2><p>The AI-first cockpit does not replace source records. These existing read surfaces remain the reconstructable record.</p></header><section id="overview" aria-label="Overview" tabindex="-1"><h2>Overview</h2><p>Synthetic matter summary for workspace tests.</p><dl class="sl-detail-list"><dt>Client</dt><dd>Synthetic Client</dd><dt>Engagement</dt><dd>Not recorded</dd><dt>Opened</dt><dd>2099-01-01T00:00:00Z</dd><dt>Status</dt><dd><span class="sl-status-badge" data-tone="positive" style="color:#166534;background-color:#dcfce7;border-color:#166534"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-status-glyph">●</span><span>Open</span></span></dd></dl><p class="sl-record-meta">Legacy references (provenance only): synthetic-legacy-container-1</p><h3>Approval and execution states</h3><ul class="sl-record-list"><li id="state-00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000